    <string name="set_sec_rules">Detection rules</string>
    <string name="rules_text" formatted="false">Real-time (single-core CPU%, ~15 s average)\n· Any app ≥35%; background ≥10%; cached process ≥3%\n· KSU module processes total ≥5%; other native processes ≥20%\n· Background wakelock ≥50% of the time, or wakeup alarms ≥6/min\n· LSP modules: own background ≥8%; suspicious when apps in scope are abnormal\n\nLong-term (since last full charge, judged after ≥30 min on battery)\n· Background wakelock ≥20 min and ≥15% of time on battery\n· Wakeup alarms ≥30/h; background location ≥2 h\n· CPU time exceeds foreground time by more than 90 min\n· Foreground &lt;15 min but ≥8% of all app drain\n· Screen-off standby ≥3%/h; awake ≥40% of screen-off time</string>
